This license covers the scripts and files of btcpay-docker-lnd-manager and every part of them
(the "Software"). "You" means the person or organization using the Software. "Annual sales
income" means your gross sales income over the last 12 months, counting every business you own
or control.

1. Free use
   You may use, copy and change the Software free of charge, for personal use or in a business,
   as long as your annual sales income is at most USD 1,000,000.

2. Businesses above USD 1,000,000
   If your annual sales income is above USD 1,000,000, you may use the Software after a one-time
   payment of USD 50 to the donation address (section 5).

3. Use in another commercial node service or tool
   If you use the Software, or any part of it, in another commercial node service or tool (a
   product or service that you sell, or that is part of something you sell), you may do so after
   a one-time payment of USD 500 to the donation address (section 5). This payment replaces the
   one in section 2.

4. If a required payment is not made
   A commercial user that uses the Software under section 2 or 3 without making the payment
   agrees to pay instead 10% of its sales income from the business, product or service that uses
   the Software.

5. How to pay
   Payments are in bitcoin, worth the amount in US dollars at the time you pay, sent to the
   donation address published with the Software (shown by /support in the dashboards and on the
   project page). Keep the bitcoin payment receipt (the transaction ID and the address paid) as
   proof that your use is licensed.

